    "chunk_text": "Gehera\u00f0 nu, men \u00fea leofestan, hu Lucas se godspellere s\u00e6gde be \u00feisse ondweardan tide, ge eac be \u00fe\u00e6re \u00dea mid \u00fey \u00fee hit neal\u00e6hte \u00fe\u00e6re tide, H\u00e6lend genam his twelf \u00feegnas sundor of \u00fe\u00e6m weorode, & him to & he bi\u00f0 geseald h\u00e6\u00fenum mannum, \u00fe\u00e6t hie hine bysmrian. Hie hine binda\u00f0 & swinga\u00fe & sp\u00e6tlia\u00f0 on his onsyne; & \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re swinglan hie hine ofslea\u00f0; & \u00fey Hi \u00fea \u00fea Cristes \u00feegnas \u00feeossa worda nan ongeotan ne mehton; ac hie w\u00e6ron him bediglede, for\u00feon \u00fee \u00dea w\u00e6s geworden \u00fe\u00e6t H\u00e6lend geneal\u00e6hte Gericho. \u00dea s\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r sum blind \u00feearfa be \u00f0on wege, & gehyrde myccle menigo him beforan feran; \u00fea ahsode he Hie him ondsworedon & cw\u00e6don, Hit is H\u00e6lend se Nazarenisca. He \u00fea cleopode hluddre stefne, & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Miltsa me, Dauides sunu, miltsa me. \u00dea foreferendan him budon \u00fe\u00e6t he swigade; & swa hie him swy\u00feor styrdon, swa he hludor cleopode, & H\u00e6lend \u00fea gestod, & hine het to him gel\u00e6don; & mid \u00fey \u00fee he him geneal\u00e6hte, he him tocw\u00e6\u00fe, Hw\u00e6t Se blinda him ondswerede & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Drihten, \u00fe\u00e6t ic m\u00e6ge geseon. H\u00e6lend him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, Loca nu; \u00fein agen geleafa \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00fe geh\u00e6ledne. He \u00fea sona inst\u00e6pes geseh, & \u00fea sona",
